1
00:00:00,439 --> 00:00:03,069
(Leonard:)Well, maybe not, but some
day we actually will be old,

2
00:00:03,075 --> 00:00:04,905
(Leonard:)and we'll look
back on this night

3
00:00:04,910 --> 00:00:07,040
(Leonard:)and remember what
a good time we had.

4
00:00:07,045 --> 00:00:09,015
(Penny:)Okay, like what?

5
00:00:09,014 --> 00:00:12,114
I know. Food fight!

6
00:00:17,556 --> 00:00:20,156
(Leonard:)I'll keep thinking.

7
00:00:22,494 --> 00:00:25,894
(Amy:)Look, I know you both feel bad
about being alone, but sometimes

8
00:00:25,898 --> 00:00:29,298
(Amy:)the best thing you can do is
take a little time for yourself,

9
00:00:29,301 --> 00:00:31,771
(Amy:)especially when you just
got out of a relationship.

10
00:00:31,770 --> 00:00:34,000
(Sheldon:)Speaking of ending
relationships,

11
00:00:34,006 --> 00:00:38,376
(Sheldon:)when British Honduras
became Belize,

12
00:00:38,377 --> 00:00:41,107
(Sheldon:)they designed a new
flag with a tree on it,

13
00:00:41,113 --> 00:00:45,153
(Sheldon:)and I would like to hang
myself from that tree.

14
00:00:49,488 --> 00:00:52,358
(Raj:)But, Amy,
when you and Sheldon split up,

15
00:00:52,357 --> 00:00:54,557
(Raj:)didn't you start dating someone
right away?

16
00:00:54,559 --> 00:00:57,089
(Amy:)Well, I... I wouldn't
say right away.

17
00:00:57,095 --> 00:01:00,065
(Sheldon:)And actually, it was
three different men.

